    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="CH7x2041-start">
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Duó Zuòxiāng (鐸作相)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Féng Yòu (逢又) also had poems.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Because he relied on his talent and was narrow-minded and resentful,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">scholars despised him.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">From the *Jiù Shǐ* (舊史) [Old History].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Angrily scolding</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Zhāng Jiǔlíng (張九齡) for being chancellor.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">His nature was quite impetuous and hasty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">and he would angrily scold at every turn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Kǒng Píngzhòng's (孔平仲) *Xù Shìshuō* (續世說) [Continuation of A New Account of the World].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">He was executed due to his impetuousness and impatience.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">In the "Zàn" (贊) [Eulogy] of *Liú Wénjìng* (劉文靜) it says:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Wénjìng (文靜) was first executed due to his impetuousness and impatience.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">His wording was careless and hasty.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Xiāo Yǔ's (蕭瑀) nature was straightforward and impetuous.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">In the early years of the Zhēnguān (貞觀) era,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Yuánlíng (元齡) and Rúhuì (如晦) had newly gained the emperor's favor,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">and affairs were somewhat divided.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Yǔ (瑀) could not help but feel some disappointment,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">and taking advantage of an opportunity, he sharply criticized them,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">his wording being careless and hasty.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">The Tàizōng (太宗) Emperor was angered</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">and dismissed him to his home.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Unable to tolerate others' shortcomings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Yǔ (瑀) was clear and discerning in his discussions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">but he was unable to tolerate others' shortcomings.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Narrow-minded.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Yǔ (瑀) was always noble,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">but narrow-minded.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Of narrow-minded and impetuous disposition.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Chén Zǐ'áng (陳子昂).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">*Táng Shǐ* (唐史) [History of the Tang Dynasty].</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Frivolous and showy.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_028-18a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-17T16:14:30.422+09:00">Péi Xíngjiǎn (裴行儉) said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.88" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">"Now, when you were young, sir, you were not outstanding in appearance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.89" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">and you seemed to be without restraint.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.90" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">I was afraid I had misjudged you!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.91" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">Thereupon, their friendship was as it had been before.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.92" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">Note:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.93" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">"bù yáng,"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.94" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">means that one's facial appearance is not prominent or distinguished.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.95" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">One with protruding eyes assisted the state of Sòng</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.96" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">—this was Huà Yuán.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.97" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">One with a furrowed brow served as prime minister to the state of Qín.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.98" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">*Records of the Grand Historian*:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.99" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">"Cài Zé had a disagreeable face and a furrowed brow."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.100" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">'è,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.101" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">is the bridge of the nose.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.102" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">Zé became the prime minister of Qín.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.103" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">Zǐzhāng accomplished what was difficult,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.104" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">yet he was said by Yǎn Yán not yet to have achieved humaneness (rén).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.105" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">Gāo Chái was extremely ugly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.106" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">yet was extolled for his perfect filiality within the school of Confucius.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.107" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">*The School Sayings of Confucius*:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.108" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">"Gāo Chái, styled Zǐgāo, was very ugly in appearance,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.109" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">but as a person he was sincerely filial,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.110" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">and was well-known within the school of Confucius."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.111" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">If one's perfect inner beauty is praiseworthy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.112" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">then even extreme ugliness, what harm can it do?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.113" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">Even a physique like Bólún's</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.114" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">is no obstacle to being a worthy gentleman.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.115" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">Liú Líng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.116" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">styled Bólún.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.117" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">His physical appearance was ugly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.118" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">yet he was unrestrained and unconventional,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.119" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">and his fame was among that of worthy gentlemen.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.120" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">And as for the appearance of Chéng Gōng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_021-5a.121" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T18:54:58.652+09:00">it was difficult to show to people from afar.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.27" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">Lived in seclusion in Leopard Forest Valley on Nánshān (South Mountain).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.28" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">Fled to live on Mount Sōng</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.29" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">Dù Rúhuì's younger brother, Chǔkè.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.30" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">When the Jiànchéng Incident occurred,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.31" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">Chǔkè fled to live on Mount Sōng.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.32" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">Pretending to be one who would not serve in office</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.33" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">Dù Yān.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.34" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">During the Kāihuáng era of the Suí dynasty,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.35" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">he plotted with his friend Wéi Fúsì, saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.36" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">"The Emperor likes to employ recluses.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.37" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">Sū Wēi was summoned for being a recluse and obtained a fine official post."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.38" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">They thereupon went into Mount Tàibái together,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.39" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">pretending to be men who would not serve in office.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.40" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">Emperor Wén detested them for this,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.41" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">and so exiled them to serve as garrison troops south of the Yángzǐ River.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.42" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">Caring for one's parents</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.43" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">Wèi Rénguǐ lived in seclusion to care for his parents.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.44" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">Letting oneself go in the mountains and wilds</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.45" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">When Xiāo Miǎn had grown old,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.46" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">he lived at his villa in Jìyuán,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.47" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">letting himself go in the mountains and wilds</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.48" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">and living a carefree life to the end of his years.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.49" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">Both were hermits</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.50" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">Lú Cángyòng and his elder brother Zhēngmíng were both hermits on the two mountains, Zhōngnán and Shàoshì.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.51" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">Went straight back to Jiāngdōng</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.52" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">The imperial clansman Kān took the *jìnshì* examination.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#CH7x2041_CHANT_022-9a.53" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-02T19:00:16.927+09:00">Arriving at the Ministry of Rites for the test,</seg>
